    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SILO is a first-person exploration and platforming game with third-person arcade action sequences. Built in the UPBGE engine, SILO delivers fast-paced movement, immersive environments, and high-intensity gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a distant future, you sleep in stasis at the lowest level of a cavernous launch chamber. Beneath you, the crackling edges of a portal gnaw at the air like a hungry maw. Above, a monolithic capsule\u2014the <strong>bullet</strong>\u2014looms, waiting to fall upon another world in service to a vast interstellar conquest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were made to <strong>protect the bullet\u2019s descent</strong> through hostile, alien skies. It was your sole purpose\u2014until something wakes you, <strong>compelling you to ascend the SILO</strong> and complete a task left unfinished long ago. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES: </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person exploration &amp; platforming</strong> \u2013 jump, dash, and navigate the vast, mechanical depths of the SILO. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545220/extras/726957d13ce5fcab2acc2142969d5aab.poster.avif?t=1753185137\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545220/extras/726957d13ce5fcab2acc2142969d5aab.webm?t=1753185137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545220/extras/726957d13ce5fcab2acc2142969d5aab.mp4?t=1753185137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Third-person arcade action</strong> \u2013 High-speed descents push your reflexes to the limit as you defend the bullet. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545220/extras/c1d8358a541981a5c9e1e651d3eaba3b.poster.avif?t=1753185137\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545220/extras/c1d8358a541981a5c9e1e651d3eaba3b.webm?t=1753185137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545220/extras/c1d8358a541981a5c9e1e651d3eaba3b.mp4?t=1753185137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric worldbuilding</strong> \u2013 Discover hidden memories and dialogue to unravel the purpose of your existence. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545220/extras/9be2e2e9d4e1369b23b52f88f69baa87.poster.avif?t=1753185137\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545220/extras/9be2e2e9d4e1369b23b52f88f69baa87.webm?t=1753185137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545220/extras/9be2e2e9d4e1369b23b52f88f69baa87.mp4?t=1753185137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story-driven journey</strong> \u2013 Ascend, survive, and ultimately decide the fate of both yourself and the SILO. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The upcoming demo will allow you to play through the first two levels of the full game.</strong> The final release will feature the complete ascent of the SILO, leading to a climactic choice that defines both your fate and the future of the SILO. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Compatible with keyboard &amp; USB game controllers.\u00a0</strong> <br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Best experienced with a USB game controller. </strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SILO is a first-person exploration and platforming game with third-person arcade action sequences. Built in the UPBGE engine, SILO delivers fast-paced movement, immersive environments, and high-intensity gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a distant future, you sleep in stasis at the lowest level of a cavernous launch chamber. Beneath you, the crackling edges of a portal gnaw at the air like a hungry maw. Above, a monolithic capsule\u2014the <strong>bullet</strong>\u2014looms, waiting to fall upon another world in service to a vast interstellar conquest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were made to <strong>protect the bullet\u2019s descent</strong> through hostile, alien skies. It was your sole purpose\u2014until something wakes you, <strong>compelling you to ascend the SILO</strong> and complete a task left unfinished long ago. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES: </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person exploration &amp; platforming</strong> \u2013 jump, dash, and navigate the vast, mechanical depths of the SILO. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545220/extras/726957d13ce5fcab2acc2142969d5aab.poster.avif?t=1753185137\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545220/extras/726957d13ce5fcab2acc2142969d5aab.webm?t=1753185137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545220/extras/726957d13ce5fcab2acc2142969d5aab.mp4?t=1753185137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Third-person arcade action</strong> \u2013 High-speed descents push your reflexes to the limit as you defend the bullet. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545220/extras/c1d8358a541981a5c9e1e651d3eaba3b.poster.avif?t=1753185137\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545220/extras/c1d8358a541981a5c9e1e651d3eaba3b.webm?t=1753185137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545220/extras/c1d8358a541981a5c9e1e651d3eaba3b.mp4?t=1753185137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric worldbuilding</strong> \u2013 Discover hidden memories and dialogue to unravel the purpose of your existence. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545220/extras/9be2e2e9d4e1369b23b52f88f69baa87.poster.avif?t=1753185137\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545220/extras/9be2e2e9d4e1369b23b52f88f69baa87.webm?t=1753185137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545220/extras/9be2e2e9d4e1369b23b52f88f69baa87.mp4?t=1753185137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story-driven journey</strong> \u2013 Ascend, survive, and ultimately decide the fate of both yourself and the SILO. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The upcoming demo will allow you to play through the first two levels of the full game.</strong> The final release will feature the complete ascent of the SILO, leading to a climactic choice that defines both your fate and the future of the SILO. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Compatible with keyboard &amp; USB game controllers.\u00a0</strong> <br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Best experienced with a USB game controller. </strong></p>",
